    <bpmn:process id="W_W1965" name="W1965. Government Catalog &amp; Price List Maintenance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Price change; annual catalog update; government requirement
Frequency: Monthly price updates; annual catalog refresh
Volume: ~2,000–5,000 items in government catalog (subset of full assortment)
Owner: Category Manager
Participants: Category Manager, Pricing Analyst, Trade Account Manager
Source: workflow W1965 — Government Catalog &amp; Price List Maintenance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1965_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1965_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1965_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1965_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1965_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1965_Lane2" name="Trade Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1965_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1965_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1965_Start4" name="Price change; annual catalog update; government requirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1965_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1965_Task5" name="Category Manager maintains government price list: (a) subset of full assortment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Manager maintains government price list: (a) subset of full assortment most relevant to government procurement (cement, lumber, electrical, plumbing, paint, hardware), (b) government pricing tier: typically 5–15% below SRP for bulk government purchases, (c) price list format: item description, unit of measure, unit price, validity period, (d) update monthly with current pricing
Responsible (R): Category Manager / Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1965_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1965_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1965_Task6" name="Government catalog distribution: (a) print catalog: distribute to key…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Government catalog distribution: (a) print catalog: distribute to key government accounts annually, (b) digital catalog: maintain on BuildRight website or government portal, (c) PHILGEPS catalog: update product listings on PHILGEPS portal for government agency discovery
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per update</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1965_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1965_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1965_Task7" name="Annual catalog refresh: (a) add new products introduced during year, (b) remove…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Annual catalog refresh: (a) add new products introduced during year, (b) remove discontinued products, (c) refresh product images and specifications, (d) update pricing per annual negotiation cycle, (e) distribute updated catalog to all registered government accounts
Responsible (R): Category Manager / Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 week/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1965_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1965_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1965_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1965_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1965_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-380 (ensure controlled execution — Government Bid, Quotation &amp; Order Processing (PA-46.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
